[en.FOCUS_C12_PRECIOUS_GIFT]
Precious Gift

[en.FOCUS_C12_PRECIOUS_GIFT_desc]
Pinkie’s gift helped Cheese Sandwich regain his purpose and hope. In order for the rock farm to one day have the strength to stand against the empire, part of Joyful Enterprises’ production line in the empire will help us manufacture some weapon components, and they will be sent to the farm in the name of Joyful Enterprises.

[zh.FOCUS_C12_PRECIOUS_GIFT]
珍贵的礼物

[zh.FOCUS_C12_PRECIOUS_GIFT_desc]
萍琪的礼物帮芝士三明治找回了自己的目标和希望，为了有朝一日采石农场能够与帝国有一战之力，一部分欢乐工厂在帝国的生产线将帮助我们制作一些武器零件，并以欢乐集团的名义送到采石农场里来。

